alse, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1753828, "client_id": 3526111, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce082737/uploads/origins/8f85e862-cf1a-4009-961d-d40d7222491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7f261b931dfa62689c836cdb3e8482d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce082737/uploads/origins/8f85e862-cf1a-4009-961d-d40d7222491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1c982d4834e5a6031c3c8338f24e6af1", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が大好きです。\n僕のキャラクター、アシュリを描いてほしいんだ。彼女は色白の肌のオーリンの女の子で、違法レースに参加する不良です。\n\nまた、(2)の画像の服を着ているキャラクターも描いてくれると嬉しいです。\n\nポーズなどはお任せします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rdAWtAtvKq7A1-n6qd8fmNDPBBMei1_F?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1753828, "client_id": 2805532, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/515968a6/uploads/origins/390c0b9b-0970-498c-8221-3516f59f9d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3a99ab4d9d7ccaa518e22346a27b74e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/515968a6/uploads/origins/390c0b9b-0970-498c-8221-3516f59f9d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=22844290b65bbc71ac6466006af2e59c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは saneto様!\n\nうちのOCマサ様はイラストをリクエストお願いします。「マサ様」は神秘的な古代の旅するキツネです。彼女はとても成熟していて賢いですが、短気で、自分のタイプの男性に恋をする傾向があります。\n\nマサ様は248㎝で、先が白い９本の尻尾を持っています。彼女は胸も豊かで曲線的な体型をしている。バストアップやヒップアップはご自由にどうぞ！\n\nありがとうございます～！\n\nマサ: https://imgur.com/a/masa-MBXe0Fi", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1753828, "client_id": 951125, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d81b266/uploads/origins/5d07ef76-3593-499d-ac40-c559b20f9e8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=716535f7cdaec2c625a6cfc6a3c7656a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d81b266/uploads/origins/5d07ef76-3593-499d-ac40-c559b20f9e8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0fdc9809d3981b6a44b4278c33948dba", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello there,\nI would like to request my kitsune OC, Miho, in your style.\nShe is a goddess of love and relationships despite her being single, which she worries about a lot. She has the vibes of an older woman who is professional at work in front of others but is a slob when in private or with people very close to her. She loves drinking wine but is also fond of coffee due to her lack of sleep from staying up watching anime or playing games.\nFeel free to draw her how ever you wish based on that description. Thank you very much in advance!\n\nMiho: https://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1753828, "client_id": 2976504, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3fca002/uploads/origins/e9be1eec-04d8-4748-9b0f-bee094707c39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1a1c28a95eee11fe6c2438e271ca4b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "h